        },
        "quote": "(a) A person desiring a moving permit shall file an application with the Development Coordination Office on a form provided by such office. Along with the application, the applicant shall:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.70.150 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "aeb63e97-ad4a-5cbd-af9c-7cfc1b2ed604",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 685,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:1",
          "start": 189
        },
        "quote": "(1) Submit a written document from any affected utility stating whether it will be necessary to cut and move, raise or in any way interfere with any wires, cables or other aerial equipment of any public or municipally owned utility, and if so, the application shall state also the name of such public or municipally owned utility, and the time and location that the applicant’s moving operations shall necessitate the cutting, moving, raising or otherwise interfering with such aerial facilities.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.70.150 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "6d24eae7-8f7d-5120-bd1f-d83ee3710e40",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 766,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:2",
          "start": 686
        },
        "quote": "(2) Submit a legal description of current and future locations of the structure.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.70.150 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "80c071ae-5608-5f3c-9abc-ac820c142ed8",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 835,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:3",
          "start": 767
        },
        "quote": "(3) Submit a proposed map to be used in the moving of the structure.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.70.150 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "649cc643-0cb0-5d13-96ec-1d4da682f4f7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 908,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:4",
          "start": 836
        },
        "quote": "(4) Submit the address of current and future locations of the structure.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.70.150 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "f4e674b7-da8c-5e4b-973d-4b078fddf163",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
