          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:7",
          "start": 1061
        },
        "quote": "(7) Submit proof of public liability insurance with limits of liability of not less than $25,000 for bodily injury to any one person and $50,000 for bodily injuries in any one accident to property in any one accident.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.70.150 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "f947762f-50dd-5253-aab0-3668551f8126",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1393,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:8",
          "start": 1279
        },
        "quote": "(8) Submit a schedule for moving of the structure as provided by the Police Department pursuant to TMC 14.70.030 .",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.70.150 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "a9d9cea7-5af9-5535-9c68-c5016b5713fb",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1501,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:9",
          "start": 1394
        },
        "quote": "(b) If the structure is to be relocated within the City, the following additional requirements shall apply:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.70.150 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "510e7068-2833-5723-ae23-0c4151eccd9b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1568,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:10",
          "start": 1502
        },
        "quote": "(1) Pay a relocation fee as prescribed by the City’s fee schedule.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.70.150 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "e2b4aaec-b066-526e-a6d2-b217af3df7e7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1681,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:11",
          "start": 1569
        },
        "quote": "(2) Before the structure is removed, a footing and/or footing and foundation for the structure must be in place.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.70.150 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "3fc26d7d-5c9a-5e89-ba08-813a6703e843",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1802,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:12",
          "start": 1682
        },
        "quote": "(3) Upon relocation of a one- or two-family dwelling, the structure must comply with the housing code, Chapter 8.60 TMC.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.70.150 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "ee1f7bb0-562a-52bc-a89b-2bce5bf1ca7c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1907,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:13",
          "start": 1803
        },
        "quote": "(Inspections for compliance with such standards may require on-site testing at the applicant’s expense.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.70.150:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
